      "nodeId": "n3",
      "text": "Sign up for our email newsletter for the latest science news You've likely heard this wild (and wildly misinformed) idea in one form or another: we humans only use 10 percent of our brain.",
      "contextBefore": "cent-of-Your-Brain Myth That Just Won't Die. Nope, sorry. You don't have a lot of extra brain power just waiting for you to access it. View Full Profile. Learn about our Editorial Policy. Newsletter. ",
      "contextAfter": " Like a horror movie monster, the myth just won't die. Various scientists and science journalists think they've killed it. But as soon as they start to relax, it comes roaring back. The fact is, this ",
